<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">
    <h1 style="color: #2c3e50;">Tournament Started!</h1>
    <p><strong>Tournament Name: <%= @tournament.name %></strong></p>
    <p>Hello <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>
    <p>We are excited to inform you that the tournament has started! You can view the match details using the following link:</p>
    <p><a href="<%= root_url %>" style="color: #3498db;">View Match Details</a></p>
    
    <h3 style="color: #2c3e50;">Steps to Activate the "Start Match" Button:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Login:</strong> <a href="<%= root_url %>" style="color: #3498db;">Login Here</a></li>
      <li><strong>Match Details:</strong> Navigate to the match details page.</li>
      <li><strong>Tee Color:</strong> Select your tee color.</li>
      <li><strong>Handicap:</strong> If you haven't added your handicap in your profile, please do so.</li>
    </ol>
    
    <p>Best of luck!</p>
    <p>Thank you!</p>
  </body>
</html>
